---
const points = [
  { title: 'Direct communication', body: 'You talk to the person who builds and supports your system.' },
  { title: 'No giant support queue', body: 'No ticket numbers or waiting on someone who has never seen your setup.' },
  { title: 'No agency handoffs', body: 'The work is not passed off to people you will never meet.' },
  { title: 'Built around relationships', body: 'Long-term working relationships with business owners, whether nearby or remote.' },
];
---
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="local-title">
  <div class="container local">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Support</span>
      <h2 id="local-title">Direct service. Real support.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Grizzly is based in East Texas and built around direct relationships with small-business owners. Whether you're nearby or working with us remotely, you can actually talk to the person building and supporting your system.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="points">
      {points.map((p) => (
        <li class="reveal"><h3>{p.title}</h3><p>{p.body}</p></li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .local { display: grid; gap: 2rem; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  @media (min-width: 960px) { .local { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr; gap: 4rem; align-items: start; } .section-head { margin-bottom: 0; } }
  .area { font-weight: 700; color: var(--bear); }
  .points { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 1rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 230px), 1fr)); }
  li { background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 1.3rem 1.4rem; border-left: 4px solid var(--tan); }
  h3 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }
  li p { margin: 0; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1.02rem; }
</style>
